# The 4-logical uncapped block of the margin sweep (dev note launcher/dev/reflex-assist-margin-2026-10-28.md): standing at the spawn point, uncapped, the
# assist as the command line sets it (off, or --mcla_reflex_sleep_assist=true), to see whether it changes the swap interval's sigma (the first measurement
# had one 177 ms swap in one assisted run). Run it with real-time steps and --mcla_fps=0. Marks: title, map_zoom, free_roam, settle0, uncapped_a, uncapped_b, end.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark free_roam
wait 5s
get ll_status mcla_reflex_sleep_assist mcla_reflex_sleep_margin_us mcla_reflex_sleep_margin_pct mcla_reflex_sleep_margin_sum mcla_timer_hr_at_cap low_latency_limiter low_latency mcla_fps
mark settle0
wait 2s
mark uncapped_a
include cpup-sample.pad
wait 12s
include cpup-sample.pad
mark uncapped_b
mark end
